 "strings": [
  "",
  "Hong Kong.",
  "In the Universal Century,",
  "it held its position",
  "as Asia's financial center.",
  "One could even call it a war",
  "between Earth and space.",
  "Even after the Earth Federation",
  "and Zeon went to war, this place,",
  "by unwritten rule,",
  "long remained outside",
  "the combat zones.",
  "War takes money.",
  "Zeon and the Federation alike",
  "needed it, so Hong Kong prospered",
  "even more than in peacetime.",
  "That, in turn, brought",
  "a massive influx of refugees",
  "to Hong Kong.",
  "Rumor had spread",
  "that Hong Kong was rich,",
  "and that it would never",
  "become a war zone.",
  "At the same time,",
  "black markets sprang up",
  "as an underground economy,",
  "preying on the refugees or acting",
  "as mutual aid, and mafias closely",
  "tied to them ran rampant.",
  "The Luo Company",
  "was a typical example.",
  "Zeon occupied Hong Kong",
  "in the autumn, as the war",
  "was drawing to a close.",
  "Zeon's",
  "stated reasons for moving in",
  "were to deal with rising crime",
  "and to root out the many",
  "Federation spies in Hong Kong,",
  "but in truth, Hong Kong's money",
  "was the main objective.",
  "By this time, Zeon's wartime",
  "economy was nearing collapse,",
  "and in terms of national strength",
  "it was in serious danger.",
  "If the taxes arising",
  "from market transactions",
  "could be diverted",
  "from the Federation to Zeon,",
  "it would be far more than",
  "a drop in the bucket.",
  "Zeon's occupation",
  "went easily enough;",
  "the trouble came afterward.",
  "The Federation wanted money too.",
  "And so, at once,",
  "troops were drawn from the army",
  "deployed in Southeast Asia",
  "for a force to retake Hong Kong.",
  "The Hong Kong Mafia",
  "Zeon's Economy",
  "The Hong Kong Mafia",
  "was one form the economy took",
  "in the Universal Century.",
  "It began as a mutual aid group",
  "for the poor,",
  "and was a violent gang as well.",
  "To keep order and stay safe,",
  "violence is necessary.",
  "That it is called violence,",
  "not police or military power,",
  "is simply because",
  "it was in private hands.",
  "In any case,",
  "the Hong Kong Mafia",
  "used the One Year War",
  "to extend its power.",
  "Some of them, putting on the face",
  "of legitimate businesses,",
  "would begin to grow enormously.",
  "To them, Zeon was at first",
  "an easy mark.",
  "Free-spending and always",
  "in need of logistical supplies,",
  "Zeon naturally",
  "dealt only with companies",
  "that were friendly to it.",
  "The Hong Kong Mafia's rise was,",
  "one could say, Zeon's doing.",
  "But that honeymoon ended",
  "the moment Zeon",
  "occupied Hong Kong.",
  "To the mafia, Zeon was reduced",
  "to nothing but a foreign enemy,",
  "and they began to back",
  "the Federation instead.",
  "Not just money, but supplies",
  "and guiding Federation units in:",
  "such was their support.",
  "Even with industry vast enough",
  "to mass-produce mobile suits",
  "and turn out colony after colony,",
  "and even having gone into space,",
  "people even then",
  "were not so rich",
  "that they could ignore economics.",
  "Especially when it was not",
  "merely a matter of living.",
  "Once you set out to wage war,",
  "spending climbs without limit.",
  "Unlike on Earth,",
  "you make your own air and water,",
  "and even maintaining the land",
  "costs money.",
  "Life in space",
  "made this especially plain.",
  "On top of the cost of living,",
  "wielding and maintaining",
  "military power costs money.",
  "As a result, Zeon's economy",
  "was by this time reaching",
  "its limit.",
  "The reason was simple:",
  "it had begun to lose the war.",
  "Markets are sensitive",
  "to the course of a war; once",
  "Zeon's losing position was clear,",
  "they scattered in all directions,",
  "pulling out of the bonds",
  "Zeon had issued.",
  "This sent the economy",
  "into a sudden tailspin.",
  "Long before its forces ran dry,",
  "Zeon was headed for collapse.",
  "Zeon invaded Hong Kong",
  "to keep its own financial economy",
  "from collapsing; put simply,",
  "this was to be achieved",
  "by exploiting the Earth.",
  "By this time, Zeon seemed to have",
  "mislaid Garma Zabi's",
  "conciliatory thinking and his",
  "composure somewhere.",
  "In any event,",
  "the Federation forces would clash",
  "with Zeon's in Hong Kong.",
  "In this battle,",
  "both sides feared lowering",
  "Hong Kong's economic value,",
  "so bombing and long-range shelling",
  "were held back, and the fighting",
  "was mostly MS close combat.",
  "The battle for Hong Kong begins."
 ]
